# Dancing with SAR — environment template
# Copy to .env.local. With VITE_API_BASE_URL unset, the app sends zero API
# requests and uses the bundled, clearly-labelled illustrative dataset.

# Backend (see BACKEND_API_SPEC.md). Leave empty for the offline demo.
VITE_API_BASE_URL=
VITE_API_TIMEOUT=10000

# NISAR data access happens server-side only:
#   L-band  → NASA ASF DAAC  https://asf.alaska.edu/
#   S-band  → ISRO Bhoonidhi https://bhoonidhi.nrsc.gov.in/NISAR/NisarProducts.html
# Do NOT put private ASF/Earthdata credentials in a VITE_* variable: Vite
# exposes those values to the browser. Keep them in the backend secret store.

# Optional deployment note: the UI degrades cleanly if the backend is absent.
